# src/

Core API types, authorization, and utilities for the Udex service. Contains protobuf-generated gRPC definitions, authorization middleware, and helper functions for context hashing and timestamp conversion.

## Dirs

- `authz/` -- Authorization and permission enforcement for gRPC services
- `generated/` -- Auto-generated Rust code from Protocol Buffer definitions

## Files

- `lib.rs` -- Library root with module exports, Error enum, and timestamp conversion utilities
- `hash.rs` -- Context hashing using xxHash (xxh3-64) with deterministic pair sorting
